;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.agoda.com/partners/partnersearch.aspx?pcs=1&amp;cid=1811968&amp;hid=2152503\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-1589 aligncenter\" src=\"https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Triple-B-sleep-and-relax-3-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"644\" height=\"429\" srcset=\"https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Triple-B-sleep-and-relax-3-300x200.jpg 300w, https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Triple-B-sleep-and-relax-3-768x513.jpg 768w, https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Triple-B-sleep-and-relax-3-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://thailandaddict.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/Triple-B-sleep-and-relax-3.jpg 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 644px) 100vw, 644px\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>ที่พักดี ราคาหลักร้อยในโคราช</strong> แห่งนี้ได้รับคะแนนรีวิว 8.4/10 คะแนนจาก Agoda.com</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">เลือกเข้าพักได้ 1 , 2  ท่าน</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">ราคา เริ่มต้นห้องละ 500 บาท</span></h6>\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">จองโรงแรม ราคาพิเศษ</span></h6>\n<h6><a href=\"https://www.agoda.com/partners/partnersearch.aspx?pcs=1&amp;cid=1811968&amp;hid=2152503\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-1893 aligncenter\" src=\"http://topofhotel.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/agodacom.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"210\" height=\"78\" /></span></a></h6>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr />\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"color: #000000;\">4.) <a href=\"https://www.booking.com/hotel/th/u-place-korat.en-us.html?aid=1670294;sid=1597487bddb039814ff86bc5919ab251;dist=0&amp;group_adults=2&amp;keep_landing=1&amp;no_rooms=1&amp;room1=A%2CA&amp